  "title": "Kenyan Cult Leader Convicted of Mass Murder and Sentenced to 200 Years in Prison",
  "summary": "A Kenyan cult leader, Paul Nthenge Mackenzie, was convicted of mass murder over the deaths of 190 children and one adult, with authorities in Kenya investigating the case after bodies were found in shallow graves. He was sentenced to 200 years in prison, with 100 years for the murders by starvation and 100 years for direct homicide.",
